                <div class="md:w-1/2 text-white mb-8 md:mb-0">
                    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">Unlock Your Story's Full Potential with WriCo</h1>
                    <p class="text-xl mb-8">The AI-powered writing app designed to help you generate ideas, develop
                        characters, outline plots, and organize scenes like a pro. Enhance your creativity with
                        AI-driven suggestions and bring your story to life effortlessly.</p>
                    <div class="flex space-x-4">
                        <a href="https://apps.apple.com/fr/app/wrico-the-best-story-planner/id6502863672">
                            <img src="app-store-badge.svg" alt="Available on the App Store" class="h-12">
                        </a>
                        <a href="https://apps.apple.com/fr/app/wrico-the-best-story-planner/id6502863672">
                            <img src="mac-app-store-badge.svg" alt="Available on the Mac App Store" class="h-12">
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="md:w-1/2">
                    <img src="iphone.png" alt="WriCo App Interface" class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-2xl">
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

<section id="features" class="py-20">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-12 text-dark">Craft Compelling Stories with Ease</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300">
                <img src="writer.webp" alt="Plot Outlining" class="w-16 h-16 mb-4">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-primary">Organize Your Plots</h3>
                <p class="text-dark">Map out your story's structure with intuitive outlining tools that help you
                    visualize the bigger picture.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300">
                <img src="compelling-charact.png" alt="Character Development" class="w-16 h-16 mb-4">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-primary">Develop Memorable Characters</h3>
                <p class="text-dark">Dive deep into character creation with detailed templates. Explore backgrounds,
                    motivations, and relationships.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300">
                <img src="Engaging%20Scenes.webp" alt="Scene Organization" class="w-16 h-16 mb-4">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-primary">Structure Engaging Scenes</h3>
                <p class="text-dark">Effortlessly arrange and refine your scenes, ensuring a seamless flow and
                    captivating narrative progression.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300">
                <img src="ai-features.webp" alt="AI Story Suggestions" class="w-16 h-16 mb-4">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-primary">AI-Powered Story Suggestions</h3>
                <p class="text-dark">Generate unique story ideas and prompts with AI, sparking creativity and helping
                    you overcome writer's block.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300">
                <img src="sync.webp" alt="Seamless Sync" class="w-16 h-16 mb-4">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-primary">Seamless Sync & Access</h3>
                <p class="text-dark">Access your work from anywhere. WriCo seamlessly syncs your projects across all
                    your Apple devices.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300">
                <img src="notes.webp" alt="Capture Ideas" class="w-16 h-16 mb-4">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-primary">Capture Every Spark of Inspiration</h3>
                <p class="text-dark">Jot down ideas, notes, and research effortlessly within your projects, keeping
                    everything organized.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

        <section id="pricing" class="py-20 bg-accent/20">
